  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling Economic Independence for Specially Abled Persons in Sierra Leone (Persons with Disabilities) - PWDs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the economic independence and enhance livelihoods for PwDs, especially women and youth. The project&#x2019;s main objective is to promote skills training, job opportunities for Specially Abled Persons (PwDs) and create an enabling environment for their socio-economic inclusion, self-reliance and independence in communities nationwide.</narrative>
  </description>
